Then
\[\cos \theta = \frac{\|\mathbf{e}\|}{\|\mathbf{c}\|} = \frac{\|\mathbf{d}\|}{\|\mathbf{b}\|} = \cos \arccos \frac{5}{8} = \frac{5}{8},\]so $\cos^2 \theta = \frac{25}{64}.$  Therefore, $V^2 = 39 \cdot \frac{25}{64} = \frac{975}{64},$ so $V = \boxed{\frac{5 \sqrt{39}}{8}}.$
